swasti śakawarṣātīta 803 asujimasa ekadaśi śuklapakṣa wurukuŋ kaliwuan śukrawara dhaniṣṭa naksatra drtiamwata yoga tatkala sa (baca saŋ) pamgat swaŋ manīma
